<p>    Esperance     162.75</p>
<p>    Fremantle     167.00</p>
<p>    Geraldton     164.00</p>
<p>NOTE: The indicator price represents the current state of the international wheat market. It is a cash contract price offered today by the AWB for wheat delivered during the 1996/97 harvest. The offer is valid until 4.30 p.m. Australian Eastern Standard Time (0630 GMT) and Eastern Standard Summer Time (0530 GMT). Indicator prices will be revised daily until October.</p>
